.TH SYSLOGAPP 1 "October 2026" "SysLogApp Preview 19" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
syslogapp \- Linux system health and troubleshooting desktop application
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B syslogapp
.SH DESCRIPTION
SysLogApp is a GTK3 desktop application for resource monitoring, journal logs,
network inspection, diagnostics, and explicit maintenance on systemd-based
Linux Mint and Ubuntu systems.
.PP
The application runs as the current user. Administrative maintenance actions
request authorization through PolicyKit. Journal visibility and socket ownership
information depend on the user's permissions.
.PP
Administrative actions do not have a fixed execution timeout. Allow them to
finish before closing the application. Package recovery requiring interactive
input must be completed in a terminal.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/syslogapp/config.json
User preferences. Package installation and removal do not modify this file.
